          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "The 15:47:20Z trigger cited in L3 shows PR #10 merged normally with MERGED_VERIFIED based on file presence on origin/main. It does not show stacking, so it only supports the \"run the gate on a fresh clone before MERGED_VERIFIED\" tightening and not the one-PR rule.",
