      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Lesson 3 wording fix: \"If a PR was merged into a non-default branch, record it as not delivered, and open or request a PR from that branch to the default branch. When stacking, state each PR's base and merge order in the PR body.\"",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
