      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "In R004 the screenshots were taken after acceptance and from a clean clone, so the lesson changes the order of events. It also assumes a screenshot tool exists without saying how it is run or whether it needs new permissions.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
