      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "No lesson appears to remove a gate, grant a permission, add spending, or touch the no-local-LLM rule, isolation, or human-work protections, so the problems below concern wording, triggers, and recovery gaps. Whether section 16, section 17 and the \"run contract\" say what the lessons assume is unverified, because those texts were not supplied.",
