    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1/claim/37",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Committed screenshots are images, so the L2 record-count check for third-party records cannot count source records in them. Whether screenshots can carry source examples beyond the journaled allowance is a gap.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1/claim/38",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "L6 (contract amendment before changing a contract-unchanged input) is justified by the 16:27:03Z and 20:39 entries. A published R001 label (\"failed its pre-registered test\") misstated an early-stop non-run, and the correction changed two research lines. The 21:40 entry shows the deviation was only disclosed afterward.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1/claim/39",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1",
      "kind": "CITE",
      "text": "journal-2026-10-10t16-27-03z",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1/claim/40",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "\"The run contract\" is not defined anywhere in the supplied evidence, so \"an input the run contract calls unchanged\" is untestable as written. The lesson also does not say who authorizes the amendment. A controller-authored amendment could change protected research inputs on self-authored text, which section 18 forbids for anything touching research criteria, results or run history.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1/claim/41",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "L6 has a detection gap. It is a pre-session rule, but the R001 label problem was found after the fact from a screenshot, and the 20:39 controller check of \"research/ diff is exactly two lines\" worked as a post-session diff check. There should be a post-session diff of protected paths, pausing under section 17 if anything is outside the amendment.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1/claim/42",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "The second sentence of L6 (published results or wording need a user decision) is stricter than what the journal shows was done in R004. Whether the user decided before the correction is not recorded in the supplied entries. It should also say the old wording and its result stay on record, so that a correction does not \"erase findings\" or \"relabel failures\" under section 18.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1/claim/43",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "r4_label_correction_user_decision",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1/claim/44",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "run_contract_definition_and_location",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1/claim/45",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261011-001500-606a90a2e3b1/candidates/0/1",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "section16_pr_granularity_policy",
